st Strategy:**\nLead with ♥3 (weakest card) to:\n- Dispose of a card that\'s hard to play later\n- Preserve high cards (♦2, ♦Q, ♥J) to block Landlord\'s plays\n- Keep the pair ♥10 ♣10 as a tactical option\n\nReason: With the Landlord at only 5 cards, I must prioritize defense while shedding weak cards. Leading with my weakest single (♥3) disposes of a difficult card while preserving my strong defensive cards (♦2, ♦Q, ♥J) to counter the Landlord\'s likely strong plays. This maximizes my ability to prevent the Landlord from winning.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥3"]}'}
