e landlord must decide whether to waste a premium card (Q or higher) to beat my J. If they pass, I win next turn with ♣8. If they play, they\'re burning a valuable resource. This is the optimal play to secure victory as a peasant.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥J"]}'}
